  "details": "Placing a Camera object on a world and enabling it through a Udon script can override the player's default camera to that external camera.\n\nHowever in the new open-beta while in VR mode, moving my head makes a reverse rotation change.\n\nThis doesn't happen in the current live version of VRchat and I need to prevent it to be happened.\n\nPlease test the behavior in the world below with using the open-beta to see the issue.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_320cffa1-4d73-4c77-b0de-b7c3cbafc835",
